  <bioghist id="3cda5b499c9ee2ce5b2b4d48fdc95280">
    <head>Biographical / Historical</head>
<p>Marsha Hunter worked at the Ford Foundation for several years. She was an Assistant Program Officer for the Foundation's Nutrition Project, and then she became an Assistant Program Officer in the Urban Poverty Program.</p>  </bioghist>
